      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "2. The petitioner is an accused in connection with Baidynathpur P.S. Case No.564 of 2023 registered under Sections 354-A(1)(i)/354-A(1)(ii)/376(3)/511 of the IPC read with Section 8 of the POCSO Act corresponding to G.R. Case No.211 of 2011 pending in the Court of learned Additional District Judge-cum- Special Court under POCSO Act, Berhampur.",
